{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$defs": {
    "WorldQueryType": {
      "description": "world.query 查询类型。spec §8.2。",
      "enum": [
        "blocks",
        "entities"
      ],
      "title": "WorldQueryType",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "description": "world.query({ type, range, filter? })。spec §8.2；filter 为 M3.5 v1.1 增强。\n\nfilter 条目为方块 registry 名（``spruce_log`` 自动补 ``minecraft:`` 前缀）\n或 ``#tag``（``#minecraft:logs`` / 短写 ``#logs``）；缺省 = 不过滤（v1.0 行为）。",
  "properties": {
    "type": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/WorldQueryType"
    },
    "range": {
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
      "title": "Range",
      "type": "number"
    },
    "filter": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Filter"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "type",
    "range"
  ],
  "title": "WorldQueryParams",
  "type": "object"
}
